This directory contains all StarlingX charts that need to be built for this
application. Some charts are common across applications. These common charts
reside in the stx-config/kubernetes/helm-charts directory. To include these in
this application update the build_srpm.data file and use the COPY_LIST_TO_TAR
mechanism to populate these common charts.

Additional information
----------------------

By default this application will be affined to platform cores.
If you wish to change this you must modify the
app.starlingx.io/component label of the pods for this application
by including it in your helm overrides values file.

Example of modifying the app.starlingx.io/component label:

```yaml
---
# values.yaml
podLabels:
  app.starlingx.io/component: application
... # other values
```

Then apply these new values like so:
$ system helm-override-update oran-o2 oran-o2 oran-o2 --values values.yaml
